cusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -789.7 2879.4 1142.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(762.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1818.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(352.6,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><rect width=\"820.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>,</p>\n<p>and substitute this into the equation for K to get:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.228ex\" height=\"3.212ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1066.9 3636.9 1419.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1166.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2222.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(375,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(536,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1174.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>So, the kinetic energy is proportional to the square of the momentum.</p>\n<p>If the momentum is increased by 50%, the new momentum is 1.5p, and the new kinetic energy is:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28.973ex\" height=\"3.301ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1106.5 12805.9 1459.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(974,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1496.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2552,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,516.8) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1667,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2170,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(422,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(791.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"2318.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5388,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(6443.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(536,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(693.6,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"2121.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9083.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(10138.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(11916.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>The percentage increase in the kinetic energy is then:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"50.371ex\" height=\"2.895ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -934.7 22263.9 1279.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,398) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(974,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1218.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1996.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(925.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><rect width=\"2240.3\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2702.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3702.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5480.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(6536.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,398) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2667,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3445,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1438,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><rect width=\"3264.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10263.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(11263.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(13041.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(14096.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(16097.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(17097.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(18875.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(19930.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(21430.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"25\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-25\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>So, the percentage increase in the kinetic energy of the body is 125%.</p>\n\n","qKey":"1lh02ipzk","paperKey":"jee-main-2023-online-8th-april-morning-shift","exam":"jee-main"}]}